  "description": "Without doubt the most stylish member of the Munroe line, the Loop offers a triple butted mixte frame with colour matched aluminium fenders and a front rack for all your cargo carrying requirements. Gearing is a Microshift 8 speed set up and stopping duties are handled by Shimano’s hydraulic disc brakes. Seido’s 40° backsweep handlebars offer a comfortable upright riding position, and Kenda’s 650 x 45 mm tyres deliver the smoothest of rides. We’ve fitted a double leg kickstand so you can park it safely, even fully when loaded. Should you wish to go further afield, the frame and fork have rack and cargo mounts.",
